  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 189d3e3b081dcc84aa2f60926508fda9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Nina
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Nina, The True One
  descriptionEnglish: 'Nina is the youngest exorcist in the group and proudly the
    owner of her 9 precious lives. If there''s one thing she''s not good at, it''s
    handling money. As soon as something silly appears to buy, she starts spending
    everything she has and even what she doesn''t have!


    Sociability is not
    exactly her strong suit. She has no patience for pretending to be nice to people
    she doesn''t like. At least she''s honest...


    And never, I mean never, try
    to pet her belly. It''s an invitation to an exciting journey into the world of
    pain!'
  nameChinese: "\u59AE\u5A1C\uFF0C\u81F3\u7EAF\u81F3\u771F\u4E4B\u4EBA"
  descriptionChinese: "\u59AE\u5A1C\u662F\u961F\u4F0D\u91CC\u6700\u5E74\u8F7B\u7684\u6076\u9B54\u730E\u4EBA\uFF0C\u5979\u5F15\u4EE5\u4E3A\u8C6A\u7684\u4E5D\u6761\u547D\u95EA\u95EA\u53D1\u5149\u3002\u5979\u552F\u4E00\u505A\u4E0D\u6765\u7684\u4E8B\uFF0C\u5C31\u662F\u7BA1\u4F4F\u8377\u5305\u3002\u4E0D\u7BA1\u78B0\u89C1\u4EC0\u4E48\u8822\u4E1C\u897F\uFF0C\u53EA\u8981\u80FD\u4E70\u4E0B\uFF0C\u5979\u5C31\u4F1A\u5F00\u59CB\u82B1\u94B1\uFF0C\u751A\u81F3\u82B1\u6389\u4E0D\u5C5E\u4E8E\u5979\u7684\u94B1!\n\n\u4FDD\u6301\u4EBA\u9645\u5173\u7CFB\u4E5F\u4E0D\u662F\u5979\u7684\u5F3A\u9879\u3002\u5728\u8BA8\u538C\u7684\u5BB6\u4F19\u9762\u524D\uFF0C\u5979\u6CA1\u8010\u5FC3\u4FDD\u6301\u548C\u989C\u60A6\u8272\u3002\u4E0D\u8FC7\u81F3\u5C11\uFF0C\u5979\u5F85\u4EBA\u5766\u8BDA\u3002\n\n\u800C\u4E14\uFF0C\u5343\u4E07\u4E0D\u8981\u5C1D\u8BD5\u629A\u6478\u5979\u7684\u809A\u5B50\u3002\u90A3\u4F1A\u8BA9\u4F60\u8E0F\u4E0A\u4E00\u6BB5\u4EE4\u4EBA\u5174\u594B\uFF0C\u4F46\u82E6\u75DB\u4E07\u5206\u7684\u65C5\u7A0B!"
  namePortuguese: Nina, A Verdadeira
  descriptionPortuguese: "Nina \xE9 a exorcista mais jovem do grupo e orgulhosa dona
    de suas 9 preciosas vidas.\nSe tem uma coisa em que ela definitivamente n\xE3o
    \xE9 boa, \xE9 em lidar com dinheiro. Basta aparecer alguma bobagem pra comprar,
    e ela j\xE1 come\xE7a a gastar tudo o que tem \u2014 e at\xE9 o que n\xE3o tem!\n\nSociabilidade
    n\xE3o \xE9 exatamente seu ponto forte. Ela n\xE3o tem paci\xEAncia nenhuma pra
    fingir simpatia com gente que n\xE3o gosta. Pelo menos \xE9 honesta...\n\nE nunca,
    mas nunca mesmo, tente fazer carinho na barriga dela.\n\xC9 um convite para uma
    emocionante jornada ao mundo da dor!"
  nameSpanish: Nina, La Verdadera
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Nina es la exorcista m\xE1s joven del grupo y orgullosa
    due\xF1a de sus 9 preciosas vidas. Si hay algo en lo que no es buena, es en manejar
    dinero. Tan pronto como aparece algo tonto para comprar, comienza a gastar todo
    lo que tiene e incluso lo que no tiene. La sociabilidad no es precisamente su
    punto fuerte. No tiene paciencia para pretender ser amable con personas a las
    que no les gusta. Al menos es honesta... Y nunca, quiero decir nunca, intentes
    acariciarle el vientre. Es una invitaci\xF3n a un emocionante viaje al mundo
    del dolor!"
  shortName: Nina
  smallIcon: {fileID: -488465286, guid: bf798d7d3335643418da4618d499420c, type: 3}
